{"id":102795721640222,"name":"Mustard Survival","desc":"- THE CAT IN THE HAT HAS ARRIVED...\n\n🕰️ Every round starts with a timer.\n\nSurvive until it reaches zero, or complete puzzles to shorten it.\n\nThey were forgotten.\n\nNow they want you dead.\n\nAt 3 minutes, they get worse:\n\n💢 ENRAGED KENDRICK – Stronger and faster.\n⚡ SCP-067 – Weaker, but extremely fast.\n🥭 MANGO GOD – Strong and able to throw mangos.\n🎩 The Cat – Extremely intelligent and strong.\n\nEach one hunts differently.\n\nStay alive until the clock hits zero.\n\n🎮 Controls\nShift – Sprint\nF – Flashlight\nCtrl – Crouch\nQ – Whistle\nR – Push\nX – Backpack\nAlt – Unlock Cursor\n\n📝 Tags (IGNORE): kendrick, mustard, blud, mango, phonk, funk, tuff, aura, blox fruits, tv off, brainrot, retroslop, 67, six seven, SCP-067, SCP 067, SCP 67, adrian, gurt, 41 unc, rapper, survival, horror, escape, cat in the hat","path":"/game/102795721640222-mustard-survival","slug":"102795721640222-mustard-survival","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/576e9b1064aee493ebee93689a3a1b700859a02af3879defe68cc9400d888df1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac8e151ffc391815d987f8597144f908/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":5105488,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-01T10:10:46.855Z","creator":{"name":"MS'S Creations","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68b571269d047330bf2e3529","title":"Good Script","game":{"_id":"68b571269d047330bf2e3526","gameId":102795721640222,"name":"Mustard Survival","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fdef84ea22bd463bea5e6adfcc99fe2ccd1c166e40381dbd1f1fba9d88602073.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-e73f5e13583ca17db9b8f80b545cf477-68451ac5732f.png"},"slug":"102795721640222-mustard-survival","path":"/game/102795721640222-mustard-survival","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fdef84ea22bd463bea5e6adfcc99fe2ccd1c166e40381db